cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you reference AGROLATTICE in research, please cite the archived AGROLATTICE
  11.19 Publication Reference Release and the associated platform paper when available.
  Source visibility does not grant open-source reuse rights; see LICENSE.
title: 'AGROLATTICE: Publication Reference Release'
type: software
authors:
- family-names: Pavlou
  given-names: Achilleas
  affiliation: University of Nicosia
