  given-names: Tania Karina
- family-names: Garcia De los Santos
  given-names: Gabino
version: '11.19'
date-released: '2026-08-12'
keywords:
- agricultural informatics
- digital twin
- precision agriculture
- crop modelling
- remote sensing
- GxExM
- maize
- field experiments
- scientific reproducibility
abstract: AGROLATTICE is a spatial agricultural intelligence and persistent digital-twin
  platform integrating field geometry, climate and weather, soil-water state, Earth
  observation, sensors, crop physiology, management, experiments, predictive models,
  validation, recommendations, outcomes and reproducible research reporting. Version
  11.19 is the frozen publication-reference release.
